config NN_PROTO_IDENTITY
	bool "nn_proto P-256 identity primitives"
	default y
	help
	  Storage-agnostic ECDSA P-256 keypair / SHA-256 helpers used by
	  the gateway broker (gw_identity.c) and end-device clients
	  (nn_proto_client.c) to derive an 8-byte node_id and sign /
	  verify nn_proto frames.  Pulls in the same PSA selectors as
	  nn_proto's NN_PROTO_KEYSTORE_DEPS.
